Repaired SQL:
```sql
SELECT T1.Company_Claim_Number, T2.Claim_Amount FROM Claim AS T1 INNER JOIN Claim_Amount AS T2 ON T1.Claim_Identifier = T2.Claim_Identifier WHERE T2.Amount_Type_Code = 'Expense Reserve';
```

```sql
